  "above_fold_text": "Search Support All logins English Products Solutions Developers Partners Resources Pricing Log in Contact sales Try for free The communications infrastructure the AI era runs on Enterprise-grade messaging, voice, and email with delivery, routing, compliance, and fraud prevention built in from day one. A single infrastructure for all - APIs for builders, ready-made applications for teams. Contact sales Try for free Trusted by 200,000+ customers around the world",
  "visible_text": "Search\nSupport\nAll logins\nEnglish\nProducts\nSolutions\nDevelopers\nPartners\nResources\nPricing\nLog in\nContact sales\nTry for free\nThe communications infrastructure the AI era runs on\n\nEnterprise-grade messaging, voice, and email with delivery, routing, compliance, and fraud prevention built in from day one. A single infrastructure for all - APIs for builders, ready-made applications for teams.\n\nContact sales\nTry for free \nTrusted by 200,000+ customers around the world\nMarketing campaigns\nEngage customers and increase conversions with messaging and email marketing campaigns.\nLearn more\nNotifications and alerts\nInform customers and improve satisfaction with vital account, service, or event updates.\nLearn more\nIdentity and security\nSafeguard customer data and increase trust with email, messaging, verification and voice APIs.\nLearn more\nCustomer care\nSupport customers and increase customer satisfaction with timely pre- and post-sale service on any channel.\nLearn more\n\nAPIS\n\nMessaging, email, and voice APIs to help developers build better products\n\nStart small or scale globally—our messaging, email, and voice APIs provide the secure, reliable foundation you need to connect with every handset worldwide.\n\nTalk to an expert\nView APIs\n\nAPPLICATIONS\n\nUser-friendly apps to help marketers engage their customers\n\nSend messages, create email campaigns, and build chatbots that improve customer experience and grow your business.\n\nTalk to an expert\nView applications\n\nNETWORK CONNECTIVITY\n\nProducts to help businesses connect to global communication networks\n\nOptimize your operations with our comprehensive infrastructure, designed to manage everything from number provisioning to complex routing services.\n\nTalk to an expert\nView network solutions\n\nGLOBAL COMMUNICATION PLATFORM\n\nThe infrastructure 200,000+ businesses and their AI agents trust\n\nMost messaging platforms route through multiple intermediaries. Sinch connects directly with fewer hops, better deliverability, and 99.99% uptime across 190+ countries. One infrastructure for messaging, voice, and email.\n\nExplore our infrastructure\n600+\ndirect operator connects\n160M+\nactive phone numbers\n250B+\nUS voice minutes a year\n1T+\ntexts and emails sent yearly\nHow skincare brand Clarins increased engagement rates by 2.5x with RCS\nRetail\nRich SMS\nRCS\n79%\nread rate\n3.5x\nmore redirections than Rich SMS campaigns\nRead the customer story\nHow Your Voice scales smarter conversations with Sinch’s APIs and infrastructure\n“Our applications are running on Sinch’s gateways. Voice traffic, SMS traffic, soon email — they all flow in and out through Sinch.”\nSMS API\nElastic SIP Trunking\nIVR\nJayson Millson\nCo-founder and CEO, Your Voice Global Technologies\nRead the customer story\nHow EasyPark Group keeps millions of users informed with SMS and RCS\nVerification APIs\nSMS API\nRCS\n97%\ndelivery rate\nMillions\nof messages delivered\nRead the customer story\nHow Yandy earns a 20x ROI using SMS\nSMS API\nEcommerce\n35%\nSMS click-through rate\n100K\nSMS subscribers in two years\nRead the customer story\n“By adding SMS, our clients are finding their response rates quicker, payments are being collected faster, and they’re not seeing as many suspended accounts.”\nTelecommunications\nSMS\nEmail\nJennifer McLean\nVice President of Operations, Ivrnet\nRead the customer story\n\nSINCH AI\n\nSee how Sinch AI powers safer, smarter conversational experiences\nFrom our connectivity layer to our applications, we leverage AI to reduce fraud and help you get more done with less work.\nMeet Sinch AI\n\nRCS FOR BUSINESS\n\nEnter a world of rich, engaging messaging\nDeliver branded, verified messages that feel like an app experience, straight in the user’s SMS inbox.\nMeet Sinch RCS\nLearn why we're the trusted CPaaS leader\nReports\nSinch is a 2026 Gartner® Magic Quadrant™ Leader for CPaaS\nReports\nSinch named a Leader in IDC MarketScape for Communications Engagement Platforms\nReports\nThe AI Production Paradox\nContact sales\nFollow us\nTrusted & certified\nAmericas - Atlanta, GA, USA\n+1 844-84-SINCH\n\nMon-Friday 9AM-6PM EST\n\nEMEA - Stockholm, Sweden\n+46 8 446 828 03\n\nMon-Friday 8AM-5PM CET\n\nAPAC - Singapore\n+65 317 46240\n\nMon-Friday 9AM-6PM UTC\n\nAPAC - Melbourne, Australia\n1300 558 441\n\nMon-Friday 9am-5:30pm AEST\n\nProducts\nBusiness Phone Numbers\nSinch Voice\nSinch Engage\nConversation API\nVerification API\nMailgun\nMailjet\nEmail on Acid\nSimpleTexting\nClickSend\nChatlayer\nContact Pro\nAll Products\nResources\nNews\nCustomer Stories\nTrust Center\nHelp Center\nService Status\nSubmit a Ticket\nBecome a Partner\nRCS Messaging\nThe AI Production Paradox\nState of Customer Communications\nCustomer Connections Report\nBlog\nSinch Answers\nSitemap\nCompany\nAbout Us\nWhy Sinch\nSinch Group\nInfrastructure\nSinch AI\nCareers\nInvestors\nSustainability\nContact Us\nTry for Free\n\nCopyright © 2026 Sinch All Rights Reserved.\n\nLegal Privacy Cookie Notice Report Scams/Fraud Law Enforcement Support Exigent Circumstance",
